  "description": "The Colossus was a mobile starship refueling station on the ocean planet Castilon in the Western Reaches of the Mid Rim. It was operated by Captain Imanuel Doza, who resided in the station's upper levels with his daughter Torra. The Colossus was defended by a squadron of skilled pilots, known as Ace Squadron, and was also home to many other individuals such as Jarek Yeager, who owned a repair shop on the station.",
